WEBVTT

01:31.560 --> 01:34.990
[NORTHWARD]

01:35.140 --> 01:37.990
[Episode 3]

02:04.000 --> 02:05.510
It's ready. Here.

02:09.430 --> 02:10.449
How is it?

02:11.440 --> 02:12.700
I won't comment on other dishes.

02:12.720 --> 02:13.570
But this eel noodles...

02:13.600 --> 02:15.640
You've mastered the essence from Haikuo's father.

02:17.210 --> 02:18.440
Let's work together

02:18.470 --> 02:19.930
and set up a stall at the night market.

02:19.960 --> 02:21.470
We'll split the profit evenly.

02:21.510 --> 02:23.360
If Xingchi's the one cooking, what's your role then?

02:23.380 --> 02:24.600
Siyi, here.

02:24.930 --> 02:25.690
Eat it while it's hot.

02:25.710 --> 02:27.270
What? You have a problem with me?

02:27.710 --> 02:28.870
-Eat up.
-Thank you.

02:28.990 --> 02:30.150
Are you okay?

02:31.329 --> 02:32.690
Come here and let me hit you!

02:32.720 --> 02:33.940
I noticed you have been quiet

02:33.960 --> 02:35.150
this whole afternoon.

02:35.260 --> 02:36.270
Are you in shock?

02:38.150 --> 02:39.030
Delicious.

02:43.270 --> 02:44.700
Tell me.

02:44.720 --> 02:47.840
Did that man who jumped into the river not think about his wife and kids?

02:49.620 --> 02:50.690
I guess...

02:50.770 --> 02:52.610
he couldn't handle it.

02:53.000 --> 02:55.010
If this happened to my dad,

02:55.140 --> 02:56.600
he wouldn't be like him.

02:56.680 --> 02:57.810
What are you talking about?

02:58.770 --> 02:59.850
Blah!

03:00.630 --> 03:01.590
What a jinx!

03:02.390 --> 03:03.310
Blah!

03:04.110 --> 03:05.250
My grandpa said that

03:05.410 --> 03:06.290
as a man,

03:06.320 --> 03:07.490
we might not have to be rich.

03:07.510 --> 03:09.070
But, we must be responsible.

03:09.100 --> 03:10.820
Even if the sky falls, you have to hold it up.

03:11.310 --> 03:13.600
All the men in our yard are like this.

03:13.830 --> 03:15.740
Chen Rui doesn't live in our yard though.

03:16.840 --> 03:19.010
Don't flatter yourself.

03:19.190 --> 03:20.870
You haven't paid me back for the ice cream.

03:20.910 --> 03:21.750
What a man.

03:22.070 --> 03:24.140
Don't charge to my card when you go to the cyber cafe next time.

03:24.910 --> 03:25.870
No problem.

03:25.900 --> 03:27.660
The next time you ask me to wash your swimming trunks after you are done,

03:27.680 --> 03:28.840
I'll charge you 10 yuan each time.

03:29.070 --> 03:29.900
That's great.

03:29.930 --> 03:32.010
From now on, my noodles are 50 yuan.

03:32.270 --> 03:33.250
Suit yourselves.

03:33.670 --> 03:35.110
Why do you just ask for 500 yuan?

03:35.130 --> 03:36.210
If you sell 800 bowls every day,

03:36.240 --> 03:37.390
you'll be rich in a month.

03:37.420 --> 03:39.100
You can then hire me to be your bodyguard.

03:39.510 --> 03:41.590
I’ll pay you to shut up, how's that?

03:42.750 --> 03:43.470
Xia Fenghua!

03:43.500 --> 03:44.590
-Let go.
-Everyone's watching.

03:46.110 --> 03:46.910
What?

03:46.940 --> 03:47.870
I didn't say anything!

03:47.870 --> 03:48.829
You are pulling so hard!

03:48.829 --> 03:49.430
Let go!

03:49.570 --> 03:50.910
I'm going to get you!

03:51.410 --> 03:52.540
Xia Fenghua!

03:52.540 --> 03:53.110
See that?

03:53.110 --> 03:54.270
The women in our yard

03:54.270 --> 03:55.370
are something, aren't they?

03:55.870 --> 03:57.150
I'm didn't even interfere!

03:58.790 --> 03:59.670
Hurry up.

04:08.440 --> 04:09.680
Let's go, Siyi.

04:10.710 --> 04:12.480
Let's go!

04:12.880 --> 04:15.010
Wait for us!

04:15.110 --> 04:19.070
Darling, take your time.

04:19.600 --> 04:23.510
Be careful of the thorny roses up ahead.

04:23.510 --> 04:24.950
Stop singing, I'm begging you.

04:24.950 --> 04:26.550
Are you singing or casting a spell?

04:26.550 --> 04:30.830
Darling, open your mouth.

04:30.830 --> 04:37.070
-It's awful. Siyi, please make them stop!
-The fragrance of flowers in the wind will intoxicate you.

04:37.070 --> 04:41.550
Darling, let's dance.

04:50.550 --> 04:52.420
Say less.

04:52.450 --> 04:54.010
Siyi, remember to eat well.

04:54.040 --> 04:55.090
We'll pick you up after school.

04:55.110 --> 04:57.070
Why don't you ask me to eat more?

04:57.409 --> 04:58.940
Day in and out.

04:59.710 --> 05:00.630
We are here.

05:00.840 --> 05:02.900
[Honghuai No.1 High School]

05:03.340 --> 05:04.500
I'm off.

05:04.630 --> 05:05.800
-Bye.
-Bye.

05:05.830 --> 05:06.630
Come back.

05:08.220 --> 05:11.110
Your hair is messy every day.

05:11.940 --> 05:13.260
All right, go ahead.

05:13.280 --> 05:14.320
-Bye.
-Bye.

05:14.370 --> 05:14.680
Bye.

05:14.720 --> 05:15.560
Morning!

05:18.490 --> 05:20.460
Liang, you're up to no good again, aren't you?

05:20.610 --> 05:22.110
What's wrong? Is Siyi made of porcelain?

05:22.110 --> 05:23.360
Is she going to break apart with my greeting?

05:25.150 --> 05:26.910
Who are you to address Siyi?

05:26.930 --> 05:28.090
Who do you think you are?

05:28.370 --> 05:31.330
I'm the oldest, while your dad's just the second in line.

05:31.350 --> 05:32.159
Alright.

05:32.190 --> 05:33.550
You're already a senior. Calm down.

05:33.570 --> 05:35.290
Why argue with a fool?

05:35.710 --> 05:37.150
Siyi, go to class.

05:37.880 --> 05:38.909
-Bye.
-Bye.

05:38.930 --> 05:40.550
Wanghe, Fenghua, good morning!

05:40.870 --> 05:41.540
Chen Rui.

05:41.950 --> 05:42.580
-Morning.
-Morning.

05:42.610 --> 05:43.240
Morning.

05:44.590 --> 05:45.820
Take good care of Siyi.

05:45.850 --> 05:46.880
Make sure she eats.

05:46.920 --> 05:48.270
Tell me if anyone bullies her.

05:48.290 --> 05:50.170
Okay, don't worry. I'm off.

05:50.230 --> 05:51.150
I'm off!

05:52.210 --> 05:54.050
Hurry up. We're late.

06:00.440 --> 06:02.350
The school has a rule against wigs.

06:02.350 --> 06:03.500
Take it off.

06:03.530 --> 06:04.290
Okay.

06:04.320 --> 06:05.640
Take it off now.

06:13.880 --> 06:15.260
Are you crazy?

06:15.310 --> 06:16.310
Say that again.

06:16.340 --> 06:17.970
Be careful. Don't hurt him.

06:18.000 --> 06:19.920
Oh, that must have hurt.

06:20.510 --> 06:22.150
Just wait and see, Fenghua.

06:22.180 --> 06:23.390
What should I be waiting for?

06:23.430 --> 06:25.470
Should I wait for your funeral so that you can treat me to a feast?

06:26.360 --> 06:28.840
When you get married, I'll throw you a wedding banquet.

06:32.590 --> 06:34.470
How shameless!

06:35.360 --> 06:38.560
Look at her, Mr. Xu!

06:39.940 --> 06:42.380
Mr. Xu, look at your student!

06:43.320 --> 06:44.990
Last year, there were 10 students

06:44.110 --> 06:50.300
[Giving our best to prepare for the college entrance exam]

06:45.150 --> 06:46.350
from No. 7 High School

06:46.350 --> 06:47.520
who got into universities.

06:47.790 --> 06:50.470
Two of them even got into key universities

06:50.670 --> 06:52.310
and changed their own fate.

06:52.520 --> 06:54.940
These role models are right in front of you guys.

06:54.990 --> 06:56.960
Whichever path you choose to take,

06:57.100 --> 06:59.140
the decision lies right in your own hands.

06:59.790 --> 07:01.410
Students of No. 1 High School

07:01.470 --> 07:02.610
are the same age as you.

07:02.790 --> 07:04.390
If they can get into

07:04.590 --> 07:05.540
Tsinghua University,

07:05.990 --> 07:07.010
Peking University,

07:08.010 --> 07:09.680
and other 985, 211 universities,

07:10.270 --> 07:11.730
why can't we?

07:12.150 --> 07:13.200
No, we can't.

07:16.110 --> 07:18.820
Are we that unconfident of ourselves?

07:18.910 --> 07:20.380
Yes, we are.

07:25.700 --> 07:26.970
Some students

07:27.470 --> 07:29.450
always compare themselves to our neighbors.

07:29.560 --> 07:30.710
Guys,

07:31.150 --> 07:32.770
your competitors

07:33.110 --> 07:34.780
are never those from next door.

07:34.960 --> 07:37.040
For students of No. 7 High School,

07:35.240 --> 07:39.170
[Final battle in June, let's meet at Tsinghua and Peking]

07:37.659 --> 07:39.250
it's considered a miracle if

07:39.360 --> 07:41.220
they can make it to a university.

07:41.740 --> 07:44.000
And for all of you at No. 1 High School,

07:44.560 --> 07:46.520
it's a miracle if you fail to do so.

07:48.120 --> 07:49.480
So students,

07:50.540 --> 07:52.630
in grade 12, as your senior year,

07:52.960 --> 07:54.290
I hope you can

07:54.540 --> 07:55.670
work hard this year.

07:55.900 --> 07:57.310
At this time next year,

07:57.470 --> 08:00.140
I hope everyone gets your respective admission letters,

08:00.160 --> 08:01.860
and meet each other at your universities.

08:02.270 --> 08:03.880
Are you confident?

08:04.030 --> 08:05.120
Yes.

08:05.270 --> 08:06.500
Are you confident?

08:06.550 --> 08:08.130
Yes!

08:06.640 --> 08:07.760
[Final battle in June, let's meet at Tsinghua and Peking]

08:09.540 --> 08:11.380
When there is a will, there is a way!

08:11.400 --> 08:12.610
From now on,

08:11.540 --> 08:14.990
[Giving our best to prepare for the college entrance exam]

08:12.640 --> 08:14.280
students in grade 12

08:14.340 --> 08:16.030
will start preparing for the college entrance exam.

08:16.550 --> 08:18.590
With ten times more confidence and a hundred times more effort...

08:18.590 --> 08:19.750
Liang,

08:19.790 --> 08:22.230
you dare to challenge me with this resolve of yours?

08:22.230 --> 08:23.870
A real man doesn't fight against women.

08:27.630 --> 08:28.940
Do you hear me?

08:29.240 --> 08:32.570
[Giving our all in our studies, devoting ourselves to prepare for the college entrance exam]

08:38.740 --> 08:39.549
Then...

08:39.590 --> 08:40.900
if (a, n)

08:40.929 --> 08:44.090
is more than (a, n) plus one,

08:44.790 --> 08:45.950
what happens to this sequence?

08:45.970 --> 08:47.210
It decreases.

08:47.270 --> 08:48.940
Yes, it decreases.

08:48.970 --> 08:51.300
If (a, n) is bigger and equals to

08:51.390 --> 08:53.790
(a, n) minus one,

08:53.830 --> 08:54.930
what does this mean?

08:55.150 --> 08:56.590
It increases.

08:56.590 --> 08:58.360
Yes, this is...

08:59.010 --> 09:01.110
monotonic function.

09:02.880 --> 09:04.720
You're in your final year of high school now.

09:04.750 --> 09:06.460
Don't be so listless all the time.

09:06.490 --> 09:08.270
Especially you, Xie Wanghe.

09:08.900 --> 09:10.910
Come, let's continue with the lesson.

09:13.590 --> 09:14.590
How nimble.

09:14.590 --> 09:16.520
You've been trained well through these years.

09:16.560 --> 09:17.790
Thank you.

09:19.380 --> 09:22.940
[Striving unceasingly with unwavering resolve]

09:23.080 --> 09:27.660
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

09:24.470 --> 09:25.750
Everyone.

09:25.790 --> 09:26.420
Class.

09:28.060 --> 09:29.220
Have you ever thought

09:30.610 --> 09:32.750
what will you do if you

09:33.120 --> 09:34.740
cannot make it to a university?

09:34.810 --> 09:37.260
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

09:34.920 --> 09:37.040
I don't think going to university is the only way out.

09:37.480 --> 09:39.300
I can start a business if I don't make it.

09:39.800 --> 09:41.600
Bill Gates, the richest man in the world,

09:41.630 --> 09:43.210
didn't complete his degree either.

09:44.460 --> 09:45.140
Okay.

09:45.170 --> 09:46.970
Let's talk about Bill Gates then.

09:47.670 --> 09:48.880
As you all know,

09:49.070 --> 09:51.150
Bill Gates got into Harvard

09:51.190 --> 09:53.440
before he dropped out.

09:53.750 --> 09:55.110
As compared to not making it,

09:55.250 --> 09:56.590
it's totally different when

09:56.910 --> 09:58.830
he chooses to drop out.

09:59.310 --> 10:01.090
Well said, teacher!

10:01.260 --> 10:02.910
Great!

10:05.070 --> 10:07.160
Let's not talk about Bill Gates then.

10:07.720 --> 10:08.870
Let's talk about how

10:08.870 --> 10:10.310
many outstanding local entrepreneurs

10:10.460 --> 10:11.140
had no education

10:11.180 --> 10:12.010
or background,

10:12.090 --> 10:13.930
but that didn't stop them from being successful.

10:13.960 --> 10:15.470
That was in the past.

10:15.590 --> 10:16.910
Now,

10:17.070 --> 10:19.700
only knowledge can change your fate.

10:20.030 --> 10:20.790
Mr. Xu!

10:22.100 --> 10:23.220
Forget it, I'll stop here.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.010
It's okay.

10:24.110 --> 10:24.910
Carry on.

10:25.350 --> 10:26.500
If you're wrong,

10:26.530 --> 10:27.580
I won't blame you.

10:28.230 --> 10:29.390
If you have a good point,

10:29.470 --> 10:30.950
I won't leave you any homework.

10:30.950 --> 10:31.830
Really?

10:31.830 --> 10:32.960
Of course.

10:32.960 --> 10:33.840
You must keep your promise.

10:34.070 --> 10:34.870
Yes, I'll.

10:40.520 --> 10:41.800
I think...

10:41.990 --> 10:43.230
Come down.

10:46.310 --> 10:47.170
I think...

10:47.350 --> 10:48.450
you're right.

10:48.830 --> 10:50.660
Knowledge can change one's fate,

10:51.250 --> 10:52.700
but it definitely isn't

10:52.730 --> 10:55.030
knowledge memorized from the textbook.

10:55.200 --> 10:57.530
Does it mean that everyone who studied hard

10:57.570 --> 10:59.590
will definitely succeed?

10:59.830 --> 11:00.920
Then why is it that

11:00.990 --> 11:02.830
the successful ones are still the minority?

11:03.590 --> 11:04.230
Guys,

11:04.260 --> 11:06.320
this is not about getting the wrong reference.

11:06.470 --> 11:07.870
This is called switching concepts.

11:07.910 --> 11:08.660
No.

11:08.720 --> 11:09.690
Mr. Xu.

11:09.930 --> 11:11.540
What I want to say is that

11:11.990 --> 11:13.030
compared to

11:13.090 --> 11:15.560
knowledge memorized from textbooks,

11:15.730 --> 11:16.920
what's more important is

11:17.710 --> 11:19.150
our way of thinking,

11:20.650 --> 11:21.860
creativity,

11:22.070 --> 11:23.080
foresight,

11:23.350 --> 11:24.510
and future plans.

11:25.010 --> 11:27.010
We can understand the laws of a trade

11:27.040 --> 11:29.320
through observation and analysis.

11:29.440 --> 11:31.200
And with this understanding,

11:31.230 --> 11:33.630
we can get the final victory.

11:33.750 --> 11:35.030
Well said!

11:36.480 --> 11:37.530
So, tell me.

11:37.560 --> 11:40.690
How do you plan to get the final victory?

11:41.030 --> 11:41.990
Let's take an example.

11:41.990 --> 11:43.750
For example, in the teaching profession.

11:43.750 --> 11:45.100
Have you ever thought about

11:45.100 --> 11:46.150
how can you

11:46.190 --> 11:48.230
earn more money

11:48.230 --> 11:49.730
without compromising your job?

11:50.470 --> 11:51.350
Have you thought about it?

11:51.580 --> 11:52.470
Yes, I did.

11:52.470 --> 11:53.080
But,

11:53.110 --> 11:55.350
it's definitely not one-on-one tutoring.

11:55.350 --> 11:56.230
That's too inefficient,

11:56.230 --> 11:57.150
and it's not effective.

11:57.590 --> 11:58.710
If you don't reap profits,

11:58.710 --> 12:00.110
its easy to hold a grudge.

12:00.430 --> 12:01.230
Mr. Xu.

12:01.460 --> 12:02.960
I think if you want to make money,

12:02.990 --> 12:04.110
there is only one way.

12:04.680 --> 12:06.510
And that is, to open test prep centers.

12:13.710 --> 12:14.960
What center?

12:14.980 --> 12:16.170
Test prep centers.

12:17.560 --> 12:19.710
Mr. Xu, please move aside.

12:24.310 --> 12:28.230
[Test prep centers]

12:27.500 --> 12:28.450
Test prep centers.

12:29.870 --> 12:31.330
Don't you understand?

12:32.090 --> 12:33.660
It means to do test papers together.

12:35.710 --> 12:36.600
Actually,

12:37.200 --> 12:38.470
if you want to improve your grades,

12:38.510 --> 12:39.220
it's very simple.

12:39.250 --> 12:40.830
You just have to do test papers non-stop.

12:40.850 --> 12:42.320
But when you do it yourself at home,

12:42.360 --> 12:43.360
if you encounter any problems,

12:43.380 --> 12:44.420
you will never get it

12:44.460 --> 12:45.490
no matter how hard you try.

12:45.510 --> 12:47.910
But if someone could guide you,

12:48.470 --> 12:49.700
it's different.

12:49.730 --> 12:51.260
If you can get help whenever you encounter a problem,

12:51.290 --> 12:53.050
your grades will definitely improve.

12:53.070 --> 12:53.880
Of course,

12:54.060 --> 12:55.910
you can't charge for tutoring

12:55.930 --> 12:57.200
as it's against the school rules.

12:57.220 --> 12:59.760
But you can collect fees for things such as

12:59.780 --> 13:02.480
food, nutrition, printing and so on.

13:02.490 --> 13:04.540
Teachers can earn money legitimately

13:04.580 --> 13:07.030
while students can improve their grades.

13:07.180 --> 13:08.260
Let me ask you.

13:08.350 --> 13:09.710
Assuming there is such a place

13:09.710 --> 13:11.230
that runs every weekend for two days,

13:11.250 --> 13:12.370
where Mr. Xu teaches,

13:12.410 --> 13:13.050
and it's inclusive of meals

13:13.070 --> 13:14.020
with no attendance taken.

13:14.060 --> 13:15.180
We'll let Mr. Xu

13:15.230 --> 13:16.730
make this hard-earned 50 yuan.

13:16.750 --> 13:18.060
Would you be interested?

13:18.080 --> 13:20.680
50 yuan is too expensive.

13:20.990 --> 13:22.020
How about 48 yuan?

13:22.030 --> 13:23.170
48 yuan is also expensive.

13:23.200 --> 13:24.080
How about 44 yuan?

13:24.110 --> 13:25.900
That number is unlucky.

13:25.950 --> 13:27.070
If it's 44 yuan, I'll sign up.

13:27.080 --> 13:28.130
I'll attend too!

13:28.170 --> 13:29.680
We must support Mr. Xu.

13:30.000 --> 13:30.560
Me too!

13:30.590 --> 13:31.670
Me too!

13:31.710 --> 13:33.050
Me too!

13:33.210 --> 13:34.130
Mr. Xu.

13:34.230 --> 13:34.830
Inclusive of me,

13:34.830 --> 13:36.230
there are 40 people in this class.

13:36.230 --> 13:36.990
Enough.

13:36.990 --> 13:38.390
That's not a lot of money either.

13:38.430 --> 13:40.950
My time is very precious too.

13:41.300 --> 13:42.950
Mr. Xu, don't fret.

13:43.080 --> 13:44.470
Let me calculate for you.

13:44.470 --> 13:45.990
There are 52 weekends a year.

13:45.990 --> 13:50.120
52 times 44, times 40.

13:50.240 --> 13:51.050
How much is that?

13:51.070 --> 13:53.140
91,520 yuan.

13:54.390 --> 13:56.940
91,520 yuan.

13:58.770 --> 14:00.700
This is just the fees from one class.

14:00.750 --> 14:01.590
If you think it's not enough,

14:01.590 --> 14:02.950
we can recruit more.

14:04.180 --> 14:07.140
You can calculate how much you will get with a 2 percent expansion

14:07.160 --> 14:08.800
via geometric progression.

14:08.840 --> 14:09.670
You can calculate first.

14:09.710 --> 14:11.530
I'll go back and drink some water.

14:18.230 --> 14:18.750
Class.

14:18.750 --> 14:20.050
Class!

14:20.080 --> 14:21.060
Don't get carried away.

14:21.260 --> 14:22.870
Let's calculate

14:22.870 --> 14:24.630
this question by Mr. Xie.

14:24.670 --> 14:26.060
Okay.

14:26.100 --> 14:26.850
Assuming

14:26.880 --> 14:29.560
the number of graduating seniors of Honghuai is

14:29.670 --> 14:30.900
5,850 students.

14:30.950 --> 14:33.510
Of which, 80 percent are science students.

14:35.470 --> 14:36.110
Mr. Xu,

14:36.110 --> 14:37.380
please don't calculate anymore.

14:37.590 --> 14:38.870
If this continues,

14:38.870 --> 14:40.070
in the near future,

14:40.110 --> 14:41.900
you'll be billionaire!

14:42.470 --> 14:44.690
A billionaire?

14:44.830 --> 14:45.360
Mr. Xu,

14:45.430 --> 14:47.070
you're doing this alone.

14:47.070 --> 14:48.690
When you resign

14:48.860 --> 14:50.270
and focus on this,

14:50.310 --> 14:51.830
we can hire

14:51.830 --> 14:53.230
all of the retired senior teachers

14:53.230 --> 14:54.110
over here.

14:54.110 --> 14:55.350
By then,

14:55.350 --> 14:57.240
we can move out of Honghuai

14:57.240 --> 14:59.470
and set up test prep centers across the country.

14:59.470 --> 15:00.950
Once you have scaled up sufficiently

15:00.990 --> 15:02.160
you can apply for land

15:02.470 --> 15:03.710
to establish

15:03.710 --> 15:05.360
a national test prep center.

15:05.830 --> 15:07.250
By then,

15:07.710 --> 15:09.430
we can advertise,

15:09.470 --> 15:10.830
get financing and go public.

15:10.830 --> 15:12.350
As long as policies remain unchanged,

15:12.460 --> 15:13.750
before you turn 50,

15:13.750 --> 15:16.210
you'll achieve financial freedom.

15:16.740 --> 15:17.710
Mr. Xu!

15:17.710 --> 15:19.980
You will be the richest man in Honghuai!

15:22.990 --> 15:23.830
Mr. Xu!

15:23.830 --> 15:24.750
The richest man!

15:24.750 --> 15:25.790
Mr. Xu!

15:25.840 --> 15:27.060
The richest man!

15:27.060 --> 15:27.940
Mr. Xu!

15:27.940 --> 15:29.190
The richest man!

15:29.190 --> 15:30.070
Mr. Xu!

15:30.070 --> 15:30.990
The richest man!

15:31.590 --> 15:32.750
Mr. Xu, Mr. Xu!

15:33.300 --> 15:34.990
Don't forget us when you are rich!

15:35.200 --> 15:36.080
Mr. Xu!

15:36.230 --> 15:37.470
Don't forget us!

15:37.470 --> 15:38.350
Mr. Xu!

15:38.350 --> 15:39.510
Don't forget us!

15:39.510 --> 15:40.390
Mr. Xu!

15:40.430 --> 15:41.590
Don't forget us!

15:41.590 --> 15:42.470
You've explained so much to them.

15:42.470 --> 15:43.590
Did they even understand?

15:43.590 --> 15:46.110
The swallows and sparrows will never understand the ambition of a swan.

15:46.110 --> 15:49.260
It's a waste of effort if you tell those who don't understand.

15:51.960 --> 15:53.730
I could have knocked into you.

15:54.940 --> 15:56.040
What do you want now?

15:56.070 --> 15:57.710
Tell Xia Fenghua

15:57.730 --> 15:58.610
she owes me money.

15:58.650 --> 15:59.990
What money?

16:01.690 --> 16:02.540
These are Air Force 1's.

16:02.560 --> 16:03.810
I just bought it from Shanghai.

16:03.840 --> 16:05.520
Look at how she stepped on them. How am I supposed to wear them?

16:05.540 --> 16:06.420
How much is it?

16:06.460 --> 16:07.470
Don't ask.

16:07.490 --> 16:08.810
You won't be able to afford it anyway.

16:08.840 --> 16:10.380
So what do you want?

16:10.450 --> 16:11.790
Not much.

16:12.280 --> 16:14.690
It's just a pair of shoes, it's no big deal.

16:14.720 --> 16:16.050
I can get a new pair every day if I want to.

16:16.070 --> 16:17.310
Would you die if you don't show off?

16:17.350 --> 16:19.030
Of course I should show off when I have the money.

16:19.050 --> 16:20.330
Unlike someone,

16:20.360 --> 16:23.200
who thinks about money but his pockets are empty.

16:23.220 --> 16:25.050
All you do is brag.

16:26.990 --> 16:28.070
Liang.

16:28.090 --> 16:30.430
You're so annoying all the time.

16:30.450 --> 16:33.000
Are you trying to get beaten up to scam for medical fees?

16:33.030 --> 16:34.920
Do you really think I can't beat you?

16:38.630 --> 16:40.310
Tell Fenghua I'll wear new shoes every day.

16:40.350 --> 16:42.620
If she has the guts, tell her to find me every day.

16:43.770 --> 16:44.970
One word.

16:45.000 --> 16:45.780
Despicable.

16:47.410 --> 16:50.420
If only I had brains like Wanghe.

16:50.470 --> 16:51.670
I would make a lot of money

16:51.690 --> 16:53.930
and take you to Chris' concert by plane.

16:54.190 --> 16:55.450
The concert is not that expensive.

16:55.480 --> 16:56.360
Yeah.

16:56.390 --> 16:58.550
We just have to save some pocket money.

16:58.590 --> 17:00.570
I want to buy first-row seats.

17:00.600 --> 17:02.230
When Chris is in the middle of a song,

17:02.280 --> 17:04.359
I'll rush up and give her a hug.

17:04.390 --> 17:06.109
I won't budge even if eight guards come for me.

17:06.130 --> 17:08.250
Chris will be so annoyed at you.

17:08.290 --> 17:09.589
That's fine.

17:09.609 --> 17:11.079
As long as she remembers me.

17:11.369 --> 17:13.250
I want to leave the most lasting mark

17:13.280 --> 17:15.440
in Chris' performing career.

17:15.460 --> 17:17.339
One word.

17:17.369 --> 17:18.400
Despicable.

17:18.900 --> 17:19.579
Hurry up.

17:19.609 --> 17:20.609
Coming.

17:21.849 --> 17:23.240
Let's go.

17:25.460 --> 17:27.069
♫The second hand turns, tick-tock♫

17:27.579 --> 17:29.570
♫Tiny time difference, ticking away♫

17:30.020 --> 17:33.720
♫As I sip my morning tea, moonlight spills on your hair♫

17:30.370 --> 17:32.380
Ladies and gentlemen,

17:32.400 --> 17:34.040
welcome to my concert.

17:35.400 --> 17:37.070
♫A parallel painting, tick-tock♫

17:36.460 --> 17:38.750
Dear audience, how are you?

17:37.670 --> 17:39.580
♫When will our time cross?♫

17:38.750 --> 17:41.350
Let me see your waving hands!

17:40.190 --> 17:42.670
♫Let's meet at the next intersection♫

17:41.350 --> 17:43.750
Let me hear you call my name!

17:44.990 --> 17:47.710
What? I can't hear you!

17:47.710 --> 17:49.550
No, I disagree!

17:51.510 --> 17:53.630
We agreed to lend it this time.

17:53.630 --> 17:54.670
It's just six months.

17:54.700 --> 17:56.630
My sister wants to open a cyber cafe.

17:56.630 --> 17:58.300
She'll pay us back when she makes money.

17:58.340 --> 18:00.510
She still owe us money from when she opened the noodle house previously.

18:00.510 --> 18:02.830
And all the previous times, she hasn't paid back yet.

18:02.830 --> 18:04.980
Hasn't she return the money that one time?

18:05.000 --> 18:06.440
Your mom!

18:06.480 --> 18:07.630
What are you talking about?

18:07.650 --> 18:09.350
The money was given to your mom.

18:09.350 --> 18:10.710
Will we ever get the money back?

18:12.310 --> 18:14.570
How many times has your mom visited in the past two years?

18:15.330 --> 18:17.530
So what? My mom can't come?

18:17.550 --> 18:18.920
It's not that she can't come.

18:18.950 --> 18:21.300
Every time she comes, she brings with her the whole family.

18:21.350 --> 18:22.630
They just eat and take things from us.

18:22.630 --> 18:25.030
I've finally saved some money, but all of that went to your sister.

18:25.070 --> 18:26.240
Do I owe her?

18:27.180 --> 18:30.180
Alright. I owe them, okay?

18:30.240 --> 18:32.270
My sister is taking care of our mother for me

18:32.310 --> 18:33.770
and fulfiling filial duties on my behalf.

18:33.780 --> 18:35.760
So what if she takes a bit of advantage?

18:35.830 --> 18:36.870
She can't?

18:38.520 --> 18:40.610
If you've already decided, what else is there to discuss with me?

18:41.470 --> 18:42.470
The bankbook is in the drawer.

18:42.870 --> 18:43.660
I quit.

18:44.070 --> 18:44.510
I'm leaving.

18:44.510 --> 18:45.640
Where are you going?

18:45.670 --> 18:46.710
-It’s dark.
-Leave me alone.

18:46.710 --> 18:49.230
Just tell me if you want to lend or not.

18:49.230 --> 18:50.510
No, I don't want to.

18:51.390 --> 18:52.430
Why should I?

18:53.270 --> 18:55.550
When our business was doing well,

18:55.570 --> 18:56.740
did I say anything?

18:56.990 --> 18:58.750
I tolerated all the injustice.

18:59.140 --> 19:00.570
But don't you know

19:00.750 --> 19:02.320
the situation at the canal?

19:02.750 --> 19:03.550
Seafaring?

19:03.550 --> 19:04.950
How much you used to earn in a day?

19:04.990 --> 19:06.230
How much do you earn now?

19:06.850 --> 19:08.200
If you aren't keeping tabs,

19:08.230 --> 19:09.550
I am.

19:10.150 --> 19:12.230
How are we going to live?

19:21.660 --> 19:22.700
Have you decided

19:23.910 --> 19:24.920
on your university choices?

19:25.550 --> 19:26.270
Which universities?

19:26.550 --> 19:27.510
Tsinghua or Peking University.

19:27.900 --> 19:28.880
Even the worst-ranked

19:29.150 --> 19:30.270
has to be Renmin University.

19:31.990 --> 19:32.950
Be serious.

19:33.190 --> 19:33.870
Where else?

19:34.390 --> 19:36.270
What do you want me to say?

19:36.630 --> 19:38.710
Can I get into any university with these grades?

19:38.990 --> 19:39.710
Why not?

19:39.710 --> 19:40.820
My son is not stupid.

19:41.230 --> 19:42.430
We still have a year.

19:42.430 --> 19:43.740
Let's work hard.

19:43.990 --> 19:44.990
At the very least,

19:45.310 --> 19:47.060
you can go to a vocational college.

19:47.920 --> 19:50.620
Don't be like your dad and become a seafarer for the rest of your life.

19:50.870 --> 19:51.670
What are you talking about?

19:52.150 --> 19:53.940
You're looking down on seafaring?

19:54.460 --> 19:56.910
-How dare you look down on seafaring!
-Dad.

19:56.950 --> 19:57.430
Did you drink?

19:57.450 --> 19:59.610
Who did you drink with again?

20:00.920 --> 20:01.710
Mr. Sun.

20:02.630 --> 20:04.920
He's a big boss now.

20:05.220 --> 20:07.570
He has three big construction sites

20:07.790 --> 20:10.320
and his own water factory.

20:10.820 --> 20:11.630
He's something.

20:11.710 --> 20:12.870
Which Mr. Sun?

20:13.030 --> 20:14.180
My classmate.

20:14.270 --> 20:15.230
Liang's father.

20:15.470 --> 20:16.470
Just a shabby foreman.

20:17.710 --> 20:18.630
Mr. Sun.

20:18.670 --> 20:19.570
Crippled Sun?

20:19.750 --> 20:21.450
Did he say when he will he pay us?

20:22.860 --> 20:24.290
He said he has

20:24.670 --> 20:26.390
too many projects now.

20:26.390 --> 20:27.640
Once he has the capacity,

20:27.640 --> 20:29.320
he'll pay us first.

20:29.470 --> 20:31.230
You've helped him haul a dozen boats of cement,

20:31.230 --> 20:32.310
yet he's not paying you even a penny.

20:32.310 --> 20:33.340
That's just bullying.

20:33.390 --> 20:35.430
Mind your own business.

20:35.430 --> 20:36.710
Well then, can I say?

20:36.990 --> 20:37.910
That Crippled Sun

20:37.950 --> 20:39.140
is simply a liar.

20:39.140 --> 20:40.400
He just bought a Mercedes last month,

20:40.400 --> 20:41.150
did you know?

20:41.150 --> 20:41.720
Yes.

20:42.430 --> 20:45.990
He bought a... a second-hand car.

20:46.430 --> 20:47.470
A second-hand car.

20:47.470 --> 20:49.200
He didn't say he won't pay us.

20:49.230 --> 20:50.990
Don't bother me about this.

20:50.990 --> 20:52.150
Wait.

20:52.790 --> 20:54.350
It's cold. I'll heat it up for you.

21:00.460 --> 21:01.990
Ask him to write a guarantee.

21:01.990 --> 21:03.350
Make it clear when he'd pay us back.

21:03.390 --> 21:04.230
If he doesn't do so by the deadline,

21:04.230 --> 21:05.270
he has to pay a late fee.

21:05.270 --> 21:06.230
Are you crazy?

21:07.390 --> 21:08.620
Our business

21:08.910 --> 21:10.670
were all from him.

21:11.150 --> 21:12.270
If we offend him,

21:12.270 --> 21:14.430
we are left with nothing.

21:14.450 --> 21:15.610
You are the crazy one instead.

21:15.950 --> 21:17.550
You are working for him for free.

21:17.870 --> 21:19.550
What are you getting out of it?

21:19.550 --> 21:21.000
-You’re the crazy one instead!
-Okay, okay.

21:21.000 --> 21:23.430
Stay out of men's business.

21:23.880 --> 21:25.230
How can I not care?

21:25.230 --> 21:26.150
Let me tell you.

21:26.190 --> 21:27.790
In the past when we did seafaring,

21:27.790 --> 21:29.950
yes, we could accept late payments.

21:29.990 --> 21:30.620
We could still hold things up.

21:30.680 --> 21:31.790
But not anymore.

21:31.790 --> 21:32.550
If he doesn't pay us now,

21:32.550 --> 21:34.370
how are we going to get by?

21:34.710 --> 21:36.000
What are you talking about?

21:36.380 --> 21:38.550
H-Have I ever mistreated you two?

21:56.770 --> 21:57.750
Where are you going?

22:16.710 --> 22:17.880
What's your family arguing about?

22:19.430 --> 22:20.530
Money.

22:20.560 --> 22:21.550
What else could it be?

22:27.590 --> 22:29.460
If I get married,

22:30.120 --> 22:32.200
it doesn't matter if he has money or not.

22:32.230 --> 22:33.800
He must not be too filial.

22:35.230 --> 22:35.920
Why?

22:36.710 --> 22:38.670
The money he worked hard for

22:38.710 --> 22:40.190
will all end up with his mother.

22:40.190 --> 22:41.150
What's left for the family?

22:41.710 --> 22:42.910
Find someone rich.

22:43.620 --> 22:44.920
He can then satisfy both sides.

22:50.670 --> 22:51.470
What?

22:52.710 --> 22:54.470
If you become rich in the future...

22:54.990 --> 22:56.560
If I become rich,

22:57.430 --> 22:59.150
I'll buy my dad's boat

22:59.470 --> 23:00.540
and force him to retire.

23:01.070 --> 23:01.950
Then,

23:02.500 --> 23:04.230
I'll buy them a big house in the city,

23:04.230 --> 23:05.310
the kind with a garden.

23:05.890 --> 23:07.460
They can then

23:08.070 --> 23:09.020
watch birds,

23:09.020 --> 23:10.090
do some gardening,

23:10.310 --> 23:11.110
and sunbathe all at home

23:11.150 --> 23:11.990
with no worries.

23:12.350 --> 23:13.670
That's boring.

23:13.700 --> 23:14.870
They will be bored to death.

23:17.100 --> 23:17.980
You...

23:18.890 --> 23:21.140
don't know how lucky you are.

23:21.160 --> 23:23.630
You're oblivious to your parents' hard work.

23:27.860 --> 23:30.010
The canal is hopeless.

23:30.840 --> 23:32.650
You can't make a living with seafaring anymore.

23:33.110 --> 23:34.370
I think those on Flower Street

23:34.620 --> 23:35.790
won't last that much longer either.

23:37.710 --> 23:38.910
If you move the tree, it dies.

23:38.910 --> 23:39.990
If people move, we live.

23:40.470 --> 23:41.430
From now on,

23:41.430 --> 23:43.630
we'll go wherever there's good prospects.

23:44.030 --> 23:45.020
As long as we work hard,

23:45.240 --> 23:46.300
we won't starve to death.

23:47.550 --> 23:48.590
Where do you want to go the most?

23:50.720 --> 23:51.680
I don't know still.

23:52.890 --> 23:53.680
What about you?

23:56.710 --> 23:57.630
Beijing.

23:58.150 --> 23:59.030
Zhongguancun.

24:00.400 --> 24:01.410
I'll go when I grow up.

24:03.510 --> 24:04.710
How old is old enough?

24:06.990 --> 24:08.730
At least after we graduate from high school.

24:09.950 --> 24:10.710
Regardless,

24:11.470 --> 24:12.870
I am not going to

24:13.270 --> 24:14.430
sit here and wait for death.

24:17.940 --> 24:22.100
[Rejected]

24:19.230 --> 24:21.760
According to "Stories to Awaken the World",

24:22.270 --> 24:24.670
Du Shiniang and Li Jia

24:24.790 --> 24:27.630
boarded the ship from Chongwen Gate of Beijing.

24:29.420 --> 24:30.630
There's no Yangtze River in Beijing.

24:32.000 --> 24:34.230
It's clearly just a canal.

24:35.150 --> 24:36.630
After they came to Guazhou,

24:36.630 --> 24:37.390
they were met with a blizzard.

24:37.390 --> 24:40.070
They haven't had the chance to transfer to Yangtze River.

24:40.070 --> 24:42.030
How could this treasure box

24:42.030 --> 24:44.480
then sink in the Yangtze River?

24:44.500 --> 24:47.310
It's because Feng Menglong

24:47.310 --> 24:50.870
used the word "river" to replace the canal.

24:51.940 --> 24:53.030
So,

24:53.870 --> 24:55.230
the treasure box

24:55.230 --> 24:57.710
should have sunken in the canal.

24:56.940 --> 25:00.300
[Heaven rewards the diligent]

24:57.710 --> 25:00.160
There is nothing wrong about this.

25:04.680 --> 25:12.750
[Heaven rewards the diligent]

25:08.750 --> 25:09.710
My manuscripts

25:10.670 --> 25:12.460
have been rejected before.

25:13.150 --> 25:14.990
But previously when the manuscript was rejected...

25:16.300 --> 25:17.370
Lift up your leg.

25:17.470 --> 25:18.990
At least they would write

25:18.990 --> 25:20.990
why they rejected the manuscript.

25:21.710 --> 25:23.990
They would make clear of the reason.

25:24.990 --> 25:26.300
But now,

25:26.300 --> 25:28.110
they can't even be bothered to write a single word.

25:29.070 --> 25:30.910
It's returned simply with a stamp,

25:31.550 --> 25:33.030
and they even returned it to my company.

25:33.390 --> 25:34.450
Let me ask you.

25:34.950 --> 25:36.230
You read it too.

25:36.230 --> 25:37.830
Why did they reject my manuscript?

25:37.870 --> 25:39.000
What grounds do they have?

25:39.000 --> 25:39.790
Enough.

25:39.790 --> 25:41.200
Why are you yelling at him?

25:41.230 --> 25:42.630
He's not from the publisher.

25:42.630 --> 25:44.350
I can't stand it!

25:44.470 --> 25:45.610
If you can't,

25:45.710 --> 25:47.390
just treat it like a fart.

25:47.390 --> 25:48.870
What are you talking about?

25:48.870 --> 25:49.900
How can you say that?

25:49.900 --> 25:50.440
Dad.

25:50.440 --> 25:52.200
Calm down.

25:52.780 --> 25:54.450
I-I read the manuscript just now.

25:54.620 --> 25:55.910
I-I think...

25:56.270 --> 25:57.110
it's not that you were rejected

25:58.430 --> 26:00.500
because you are not skilled enough.

26:05.140 --> 26:07.830
Let me ask you.

26:09.260 --> 26:11.870
So, why did they reject my manuscript?

26:16.470 --> 26:19.820
I-I think it's the theme.

26:21.150 --> 26:22.500
Theme?

26:23.300 --> 26:24.570
What do you mean?

26:25.000 --> 26:26.870
That Du Shiniang

26:27.090 --> 26:29.410
are all outdated stories of the past.

26:29.420 --> 26:31.090
Nowadays, readers are not interested in that.

26:31.170 --> 26:32.780
It's not easy to read or sell.

26:37.620 --> 26:40.190
So what are they interested in?

26:40.360 --> 26:41.320
This year,

26:41.470 --> 26:43.830
the best-selling novel is called "Ghost Blows Out the Light".

26:43.990 --> 26:45.070
It's centered around tomb raiding.

26:45.270 --> 26:46.710
With your skills, I am sure

26:46.710 --> 26:47.750
you can write better stories with your eyes closed.

26:47.750 --> 26:49.310
What are you talking about?

26:49.310 --> 26:50.310
What are you doing?

26:50.470 --> 26:51.950
How could you hit him?

26:51.950 --> 26:52.430
Are you okay?

26:52.430 --> 26:54.060
How could he say that?

26:54.390 --> 26:56.140
He asked me to write about tomb raiders.

26:56.210 --> 26:58.390
Why don't he ask me to write about murder and arson?

26:58.440 --> 26:59.430
That works too.

26:59.430 --> 27:01.150
A story on a psychopathic killer who does serial killings would also sell.

27:01.150 --> 27:01.710
Get out!

27:01.710 --> 27:02.900
How inappropriate!

27:02.950 --> 27:04.730
I'm a scholar!

27:05.230 --> 27:07.910
How can I write about crap like that?

27:08.030 --> 27:09.940
I have my integrity

27:10.740 --> 27:12.690
and morals, you know?

27:14.910 --> 27:15.710
Calm down.

27:15.710 --> 27:17.030
How does he take after me?

27:17.030 --> 27:18.190
All right.

27:24.930 --> 27:27.480
When those literary artists write, they go...

27:29.660 --> 27:32.100
No, Grandpa, why don't you actually write something?

27:32.150 --> 27:32.760
I want to see.

27:32.760 --> 27:33.310
I...

27:33.310 --> 27:35.230
I don't write well either.

27:35.230 --> 27:36.190
I told you to practice hard.

27:36.190 --> 27:37.670
Practice hard until you are like a calligrapher.

27:40.310 --> 27:41.740
You have to know how to leave even spaces.

27:41.980 --> 27:43.310
You mean to leave room for error, right?

27:43.310 --> 27:43.950
Yes.

27:45.510 --> 27:46.870
You just want me to stay at home

27:46.910 --> 27:48.390
and be a housewife, don't you?

27:48.390 --> 27:49.470
That's not what I mean.

27:49.470 --> 27:50.670
That's what you meant.

27:51.270 --> 27:52.210
All these years,

27:52.550 --> 27:53.530
I've been

27:53.670 --> 27:54.630
supporting this household

27:54.630 --> 27:56.120
and contributing to our family.

27:56.310 --> 27:57.710
I don't ask for your understanding

27:57.710 --> 27:59.260
nor for you to be grateful.

27:59.980 --> 28:00.750
But now,

28:01.750 --> 28:03.390
I just want to get back what I've lost

28:03.430 --> 28:04.970
bit by bit.

28:05.230 --> 28:06.450
What did you lose?

28:06.710 --> 28:08.110
My old name

28:08.150 --> 28:09.920
was Luo Zhimei.

28:10.300 --> 28:11.160
But now?

28:11.270 --> 28:13.150
Who knows my name now?

28:13.700 --> 28:16.040
Everyone calls me Haikuo's mother.

28:16.190 --> 28:17.600
As the days go by,

28:18.640 --> 28:20.470
I've lost my name.

28:20.470 --> 28:21.150
Zhimei.

28:21.400 --> 28:23.070
They call you Haikuo's mom because

28:23.070 --> 28:25.230
that's how they've been addressing each other.

28:25.910 --> 28:27.150
Of course your name is Luo Zhimei.

28:27.150 --> 28:29.150
You are always Luo Zhimei in my heart.

28:29.150 --> 28:30.090
Besides,

28:30.310 --> 28:31.590
can you get your name back

28:31.630 --> 28:32.870
by just acting in a small role?

28:32.870 --> 28:34.190
At least in the ending credits,

28:34.190 --> 28:36.230
the words "Luo Zhimei" will appear on the screen.

28:36.230 --> 28:37.630
There are only ads at the end of the film.

28:37.630 --> 28:38.390
There are no ending credits.

28:38.390 --> 28:39.750
Stop being unreasonable.

28:39.750 --> 28:41.570
I'm telling you, Zhou Yanlin.

28:41.950 --> 28:42.870
This time,

28:42.870 --> 28:43.550
I'm definitely leaving.

28:43.550 --> 28:45.020
Don't try to stop me.

28:49.510 --> 28:51.740
It's not like I won't let you go.

28:57.080 --> 28:58.470
Right now, it's inappropriate whether or not

28:58.470 --> 28:59.470
I say something or say nothing.

28:59.470 --> 29:00.780
I'll just get scolded anyway.

29:01.000 --> 29:01.880
What can I do?

29:01.910 --> 29:03.470
Your dad treats you well.

29:03.470 --> 29:04.310
Not at all.

29:14.400 --> 29:16.550
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

29:15.830 --> 29:16.850
You're all here.

29:17.670 --> 29:19.470
So, what's your family arguing about?

29:17.790 --> 29:19.550
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

29:20.320 --> 29:22.860
♫Who is still by your side?♫

29:22.030 --> 29:23.710
My mom wants to go to Hengdian.

29:23.740 --> 29:25.110
My dad doesn't agree.

29:24.530 --> 29:28.260
♫As time passes♫

29:25.130 --> 29:26.090
Why not?

29:27.710 --> 29:30.470
Maybe he's worried.

29:29.170 --> 29:32.950
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

29:30.800 --> 29:33.530
He's afraid my mom won't come back after becoming a star.

29:33.570 --> 29:36.710
Your mom becoming a star? Your dad thinks too much.

29:36.390 --> 29:39.930
♫When youthful company fades, leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

29:40.230 --> 29:41.740
If it weren't for me,

29:40.500 --> 29:44.020
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

29:41.740 --> 29:43.870
my mom would have succeeded by now.

29:45.510 --> 29:47.110
I guess my mom resented me.

29:45.620 --> 29:49.670
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

29:49.610 --> 29:51.140
My mom also resented me.

29:50.880 --> 29:54.050
♫Of sweet dreams♫

29:51.770 --> 29:52.560
Why?

29:54.710 --> 29:57.030
Both my dad and my grandma wanted to have a boy.

29:57.490 --> 29:58.880
But they had a daughter instead.

29:59.150 --> 30:02.160
♫Life is long♫

29:59.550 --> 30:01.350
That's why my mum can't hold her head up for the rest of her life.

30:03.630 --> 30:06.800
♫No need to dwell♫

30:03.780 --> 30:06.090
That's all in the past.

30:06.510 --> 30:08.030
Why are they still arguing today?

30:07.950 --> 30:11.470
♫Like moonlight♫

30:08.790 --> 30:10.230
When they made good money a few years ago,

30:10.950 --> 30:12.470
we didn't feel like life was tough.

30:12.780 --> 30:16.380
♫Don't forget♫

30:13.150 --> 30:14.470
Now that they're short of money,

30:15.310 --> 30:16.870
they couldn't control their temper anymore.

30:17.340 --> 30:20.460
♫Life is long♫

30:21.920 --> 30:24.920
♫No need to dwell♫

30:26.970 --> 30:30.280
♫Like moonlight♫

30:29.150 --> 30:30.700
So

30:31.890 --> 30:35.450
♫The old times♫

30:31.990 --> 30:33.880
we all have to push forward.

30:34.060 --> 30:35.790
Now that our families are not doing well,

30:35.790 --> 30:37.930
they are going to rely on us.

30:38.510 --> 30:39.610
With money,

30:40.140 --> 30:41.410
my mom won't be mad at my dad

30:41.430 --> 30:42.910
for not getting the payments.

30:42.940 --> 30:44.730
Haikuo's mom wouldn't be in a hurry

30:44.810 --> 30:46.030
to go out and act.

30:46.030 --> 30:47.070
Fenghua's family?

30:47.300 --> 30:48.620
If they really wanted a son,

30:48.640 --> 30:50.280
they could just have one.

30:50.780 --> 30:53.830
So in the end, it's all because of money.

30:54.110 --> 30:55.010
I agree.

30:55.470 --> 30:56.580
Once I graduate,

30:56.600 --> 30:57.980
I will go to Lanzhou.

30:56.790 --> 30:59.840
♫Life is long♫

30:58.000 --> 31:00.350
Lanzhou? You want to learn how to make noodles?

31:01.270 --> 31:04.290
♫No need to dwell♫

31:03.020 --> 31:05.930
We see the people of the canal every day when we open our eyes,

31:05.740 --> 31:08.990
♫Like moonlight♫

31:06.510 --> 31:09.040
whose fates are also intertwined with the canal.

31:09.540 --> 31:11.620
Our parents and ancestors,

31:10.440 --> 31:14.040
♫Don't forget♫

31:11.640 --> 31:13.640
bound by countless ties,

31:13.750 --> 31:16.070
are still trying to hold on.

31:15.200 --> 31:18.200
♫Life is long♫

31:16.580 --> 31:17.950
But the young people,

31:18.320 --> 31:20.350
like the canal at the very beginning,

31:19.410 --> 31:22.710
♫No need to dwell♫

31:20.420 --> 31:22.990
seek change and innovation.

31:22.990 --> 31:26.280
They want to explore a broader world.

31:24.560 --> 31:28.000
♫Like moonlight♫

31:26.350 --> 31:27.880
Who do you think you are?

31:27.880 --> 31:28.990
You almost made me fall.

31:29.320 --> 31:29.790
Bye bye.

31:29.790 --> 31:30.300
Time to sleep.

31:30.300 --> 31:30.740
Bye bye.

31:30.740 --> 31:31.620
Rest early.

31:32.060 --> 31:32.510
Bye, Fenghua.

31:32.510 --> 31:32.910
Bye.

31:33.950 --> 31:35.060
Rest early.

31:37.050 --> 31:37.950
Get up.

31:37.950 --> 31:38.790
Stand up and talk.

31:38.790 --> 31:40.290
I know I'm not

31:40.330 --> 31:42.170
a good mother to Siyi.

31:42.210 --> 31:44.350
But I've tried my best.

31:44.390 --> 31:45.190
I know.

31:45.230 --> 31:46.480
Fine, stand up and talk.

31:46.500 --> 31:47.540
Stand up.

31:47.950 --> 31:50.550
If I didn't send her here,

31:50.630 --> 31:53.460
she would have been ruined by Ge.

31:53.630 --> 31:54.780
What did you say?

31:55.630 --> 31:57.550
I just gave birth to my second child that year.

31:57.550 --> 31:58.930
I was still confinement,

31:58.990 --> 32:02.000
when one day, I found him...

32:02.540 --> 32:03.430
He was...

32:06.290 --> 32:08.710
spying on Siyi in the shower.

32:09.650 --> 32:11.590
He is a beast.

32:11.910 --> 32:12.880
Beast?

32:13.220 --> 32:14.890
Siyi was only ten years old then.

32:15.230 --> 32:16.970
That's why I was bent on

32:17.030 --> 32:18.510
sending her

32:18.510 --> 32:20.210
to you.

32:20.480 --> 32:21.990
These years,

32:22.470 --> 32:24.300
I've had the same dream.

32:25.320 --> 32:27.220
I dreamt that Siyi's dad

32:27.240 --> 32:31.040
just standing there, watching me,

32:31.390 --> 32:33.460
but wouldn't talk to me.

32:33.990 --> 32:35.300
He was crying.

32:36.030 --> 32:38.540
I know he resented me.

32:40.510 --> 32:41.430
But...

32:41.470 --> 32:43.300
Only if I had any skills

32:43.300 --> 32:44.830
that could support this family,

32:45.210 --> 32:46.970
or if Ge more humane,

32:47.000 --> 32:49.080
I wouldn't have ended up like this.

32:49.110 --> 32:50.080
Right, Mom?

32:52.030 --> 32:54.360
Why don't you divorce him?

32:54.430 --> 32:56.270
Find another one while you're young.

32:57.330 --> 32:58.440
I won't.

32:59.270 --> 33:00.350
My life's tough,

33:00.550 --> 33:01.400
and I bring bad luck.

33:02.730 --> 33:04.350
I jinxed Siyi's father, causing his death.

33:04.390 --> 33:05.980
The second one went bankrupt too.

33:07.710 --> 33:09.630
He left a mountain of debt.

33:13.030 --> 33:14.480
You accept your fate?

33:16.390 --> 33:18.310
What else can I do?

33:20.070 --> 33:21.230
Now,

33:21.230 --> 33:22.830
our second-born has to go to school.

33:23.190 --> 33:24.950
We haven't got money for the tuition fees.

33:25.510 --> 33:26.510
Mom.

33:27.080 --> 33:30.150
Don't you still have some rental income every month?

33:30.310 --> 33:32.650
Can you please help my child and I?

33:32.740 --> 33:34.670
Help me out here.

33:35.220 --> 33:38.090
What about Siyi? What happens to her?

33:38.860 --> 33:40.260
If that's not possible,

33:40.270 --> 33:41.450
I'll head south then.

33:41.480 --> 33:42.710
I'll join a pyramid scheme.

33:42.970 --> 33:44.550
As long as I put my face on the line,

33:44.750 --> 33:46.030
I can make a lot of money too.

34:02.310 --> 34:04.790
Delicious fried dough sticks.

34:04.670 --> 34:08.550
[Breakfast]

34:04.790 --> 34:06.950
Freshly fried dough sticks.

34:06.990 --> 34:09.710
Soy milk, soybean pudding, tea eggs.

34:09.710 --> 34:11.030
There's no one here.

34:11.210 --> 34:12.969
Yes, stop shouting.

34:13.389 --> 34:15.230
Save your energy. It's been half a day.

34:15.230 --> 34:16.830
I haven't seen anyone.

34:17.190 --> 34:18.469
Granny Ma.

34:18.790 --> 34:19.960
Has Siyi's mom left?

34:20.949 --> 34:22.340
She left already.

34:22.790 --> 34:24.110
Last night,

34:24.150 --> 34:25.219
I persuaded her all night.

34:25.219 --> 34:27.440
She said she wanted to venture into the south.

34:27.440 --> 34:28.710
I couldn't stop her.

34:29.989 --> 34:30.909
Now in the south,

34:30.909 --> 34:32.230
there are many opportunities to make money.

34:32.230 --> 34:33.830
There are jobs and they pay well.

34:33.989 --> 34:35.270
I have a few sisters

34:35.270 --> 34:37.020
who went to Shenzhen and did international trade.

34:37.020 --> 34:38.190
They made a fortune.

34:38.219 --> 34:40.860
They went back home and could immediately build three bungalows.

34:40.949 --> 34:44.179
I've been thinking about how bad business has been on our street.

34:44.230 --> 34:45.989
How about I go to the south too?

34:45.989 --> 34:47.909
I'll earn some dowry for Fenghua.

34:48.110 --> 34:49.469
What are you going to do?

34:49.630 --> 34:50.550
I'll find a job.

34:50.550 --> 34:52.489
I'll definitely earn more than this.

34:52.670 --> 34:53.310
Right?

34:53.870 --> 34:55.750
How much can you earn a month?

34:56.230 --> 34:57.350
Regardless, it must be

34:57.390 --> 34:59.150
more than running this food stall.

35:01.060 --> 35:02.560
Do you think that's really true?

35:02.590 --> 35:03.860
Can she really make that much money?

35:08.520 --> 35:10.850
When they discovered the continent of Asia,

35:11.070 --> 35:12.390
they found that besides

35:12.440 --> 35:13.870
a huge market in Asia,

35:13.870 --> 35:16.850
there are also gold and spices.

35:17.150 --> 35:18.550
To them,

35:18.950 --> 35:20.560
having commercial exchange with Asia

35:20.670 --> 35:22.950
became a very important reason

35:23.030 --> 35:25.350
for them to come to Asia.

35:25.510 --> 35:26.230
But,

35:26.710 --> 35:29.140
what is the one obstacle?

35:30.510 --> 35:32.360
The traditional trade route has been blocked.

35:32.800 --> 35:34.220
So for them,

35:34.270 --> 35:35.290
what must they do?

35:35.470 --> 35:37.030
Chart a new route.

35:35.560 --> 35:38.460
[Insomnia again]

35:37.030 --> 35:38.540
Very good.

35:38.880 --> 35:39.990
And in terms of resources,

35:39.990 --> 35:40.990
they have some reassurance.

35:40.990 --> 35:41.790
What is it?

35:41.790 --> 35:45.030
Boats and navigation technology.

35:43.990 --> 35:46.770
[Take...]

35:45.030 --> 35:45.710
Yes.

35:45.740 --> 35:46.550
At this time,

35:46.550 --> 35:48.150
their geography knowledge has improved.

35:48.150 --> 35:51.290
They believed that the earth is round.

35:53.010 --> 35:54.780
[Uphold virtue, gain knowledge, foster innovation]

35:54.890 --> 35:59.020
[Believed earth is round]

36:02.730 --> 36:03.960
[Take a nap]

36:06.960 --> 36:07.960
Come.

36:07.080 --> 36:08.780
[Believed earth is round]

36:08.000 --> 36:10.780
Let me expand on a new knowledge.

36:11.630 --> 36:12.980
It's related to seafaring.

36:14.980 --> 36:16.710
[Uphold virtue, gain knowledge, foster innovation]

36:15.770 --> 36:17.350
Morse code.

36:18.510 --> 36:20.030
Morse code

36:20.030 --> 36:21.510
was invented by Samuel Morse,

36:21.510 --> 36:23.630
an American communications scientist.

36:23.750 --> 36:24.400
Of course.

36:24.400 --> 36:26.390
The first American Morse code

36:26.390 --> 36:27.630
is now obsolete.

36:27.630 --> 36:28.830
Now, what everyone uses is

36:28.870 --> 36:30.340
the internationally standardized Morse code.

36:30.540 --> 36:32.170
So if you want to use it,

36:32.170 --> 36:32.910
remember to

36:32.940 --> 36:34.350
encrypt the Morse code.

36:34.820 --> 36:35.510
Otherwise,

36:35.510 --> 36:37.470
I'll hear what you were talking about.

36:37.470 --> 36:38.070
Okay?

36:38.920 --> 36:40.150
I don't want to eavesdrop.

36:40.170 --> 36:40.760
Come on.

36:41.030 --> 36:43.020
Let's continue.

36:47.750 --> 36:58.350
[Honghuai No.1 High School]

36:49.590 --> 36:50.470
Let's go home.

36:53.950 --> 36:55.310
Let's go.

37:09.470 --> 37:10.540
What's wrong?

37:10.870 --> 37:12.670
You got caught by your teacher for snacking in class?

37:16.500 --> 37:17.330
Siyi!

37:17.910 --> 37:18.590
Siyi!

37:21.460 --> 37:22.030
Siyi!

37:22.230 --> 37:22.990
What's wrong?

37:22.990 --> 37:23.590
Siyi!

37:35.870 --> 37:37.350
I just wanted to see you.

37:37.370 --> 37:38.570
How much more do you need?

37:39.340 --> 37:41.350
I said, how much more do you need?

37:47.740 --> 37:48.930
You don't have to worry about

37:49.070 --> 37:50.260
money matters.

37:50.290 --> 37:52.450
Your job is to study hard.

37:55.440 --> 37:56.830
Do you think

37:56.870 --> 37:58.030
you're extra kind, noble,

37:58.030 --> 37:59.500
and overflowing with maternal love?

38:00.290 --> 38:01.070
You're worried I would get hurt,

38:01.070 --> 38:01.750
so you simply left me

38:01.790 --> 38:03.150
at Grandma's with no care or concern.

38:03.150 --> 38:04.230
You left me to fend for myself.

38:04.310 --> 38:05.550
I was only 10 years old.

38:05.550 --> 38:07.450
Have you ever thought about what'll happen to me?

38:07.910 --> 38:09.190
I'm 17 now.

38:09.190 --> 38:10.680
I still have insomnia every day.

38:10.710 --> 38:12.610
It started back then.

38:13.050 --> 38:14.830
You may think it's for my own good,

38:14.870 --> 38:16.850
but I'm not going to accept that.

38:17.260 --> 38:18.670
And that brother.

38:19.500 --> 38:20.990
You said you couldn't afford to send him to school.

38:20.990 --> 38:22.810
It's nine years of compulsory education.

38:22.820 --> 38:24.850
You don't even have money for that?

38:25.180 --> 38:26.270
And the damned pyramid scheme.

38:26.310 --> 38:27.910
Haven't you fooled yourself enough?

38:27.910 --> 38:29.350
You still want to cheat your relatives and friends?

38:32.510 --> 38:34.860
I really don't have much money for tuition,

38:34.970 --> 38:37.810
but Ge owes a lot of money for assaulting others.

38:37.830 --> 38:39.320
I have to pay it back.

38:39.350 --> 38:40.510
Otherwise,

38:40.530 --> 38:41.730
they will find your brother at his school,

38:41.760 --> 38:43.550
and harass him for money every day.

38:44.960 --> 38:46.120
Tell me a figure.

38:47.180 --> 38:49.300
I'll pay you even if I have to sell my blood.

38:59.430 --> 39:00.310
Siyi.

39:04.290 --> 39:05.050
Siyi.

39:30.160 --> 39:31.260
What are you doing?

39:32.030 --> 39:33.030
A game plug-in.

39:33.030 --> 39:34.270
It digs for gold coins automatically.

39:34.550 --> 39:35.950
Is this illegal?

39:37.550 --> 39:38.630
As long as I don't do it at scale,

39:38.630 --> 39:40.400
it shouldn't be a big problem.

39:40.800 --> 39:42.030
If the officials finds out,

39:42.030 --> 39:43.450
my account will be suspended at most.

39:44.670 --> 39:45.700
No need.

39:45.870 --> 39:47.630
If the hacking is reported,

39:48.140 --> 39:49.280
it may affect your college entrance exam.

39:49.350 --> 39:50.530
Don't you know?

39:50.630 --> 39:52.100
Siyi is in need of money.

39:52.100 --> 39:53.450
We have to find a way.

39:55.500 --> 39:56.340
Tell me.

39:57.550 --> 39:59.750
What does her mother's misfortune have to do with her?

40:00.150 --> 40:01.190
She doesn't contact her usually.

40:02.210 --> 40:04.030
Siyi is upset though.

40:04.310 --> 40:05.320
If she's anxious,

40:05.460 --> 40:06.750
she might really sell her blood.

40:07.300 --> 40:08.410
With her physique,

40:09.280 --> 40:10.830
she will die in the blood transfusion van.

40:14.370 --> 40:15.940
I'll borrow some money from my dad.

40:18.110 --> 40:19.550
Are you for real?

40:20.470 --> 40:22.350
Your dad's money didn't come from nowhere.

40:22.390 --> 40:24.510
You could try to just get by,

40:24.950 --> 40:26.830
but you can't take it all on yourself.

40:31.550 --> 40:33.200
There's no one on Flower Street now.

40:33.740 --> 40:35.320
Our tea eggs are not selling.

40:35.750 --> 40:37.430
There used to be some fish and shrimps in the river.

40:38.500 --> 40:39.830
Now there's a steel factory in the upstream,

40:40.070 --> 40:40.950
and the fish and shrimps are gone.

40:51.150 --> 40:53.190
There's an abandoned boat at the west gate.

40:54.070 --> 40:55.140
How about...

40:55.740 --> 40:56.340
No.

40:57.470 --> 40:58.590
Why not?

40:58.620 --> 40:59.720
No one wants the boat.

40:59.750 --> 41:00.990
It has been parked for months.

41:02.470 --> 41:03.350
The diesel

41:03.390 --> 41:03.990
leaks into the river,

41:03.990 --> 41:04.840
causing the fishes to die,

41:04.870 --> 41:05.870
and ruining the fields.

41:06.750 --> 41:07.480
Let's

41:07.630 --> 41:09.420
clean up the diesel.

41:10.580 --> 41:12.780
It's also one way that we could help protect the environment.

41:14.400 --> 41:15.210
Yes.

41:17.400 --> 41:18.290
Haikuo.

41:19.310 --> 41:20.400
Come on.

41:47.180 --> 41:47.920
Haikuo.

41:50.770 --> 41:52.650
Yes, grab the pipe too.

41:55.400 --> 41:56.340
Be gentle.

41:56.600 --> 41:57.820
Where are you all going?

42:00.990 --> 42:02.170
None of your business.

42:02.510 --> 42:03.930
Why are you everywhere?

42:04.010 --> 42:05.600
Go somewhere cooling to relax.

42:07.030 --> 42:08.030
I'm asking you.

42:08.060 --> 42:09.060
What are you going to do?

42:09.940 --> 42:11.550
There's an abandoned boat at the west gate.

42:11.630 --> 42:12.110
It leaks oil.

42:12.110 --> 42:13.300
We are going to pick up scraps.

42:13.320 --> 42:14.330
Don't go.

42:14.380 --> 42:15.210
Or I'll tell your mom.

42:15.240 --> 42:16.260
Take the hammer.

42:16.780 --> 42:17.750
Fenghua.

42:18.080 --> 42:19.550
Do you think I dare not touch you?

42:19.790 --> 42:21.340
You? Touch me?

42:23.910 --> 42:24.870
Stop it.

42:24.870 --> 42:26.390
Siyi is in urgent need of money.

42:26.410 --> 42:27.170
Let go.

42:30.300 --> 42:31.890
